% Note: theses are NOT in this .bib. They live as hand-curated markdown
% in publications.md under the "Theses" heading. Reason: theses include
% biographical content (supervisor link, French original title, score
% notes, description paragraph) that doesn't map cleanly to standard
% BibTeX fields, and the list rarely changes (oldest 2004, newest 2011).
